x=\"18\" cy=\"19\" r=\"2\"/></svg>\n        Free shipping over 483 kr\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-trustbar-item\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 L4 6 L4 13 c0 5 4 7 8 8 c4 -1 8 -3 8 -8 L20 6 Z\"/><polyline points=\"9,12 11,14 15,10\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg>\n        60-day open purchase\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ts-trustbar-item\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"12,3 14.5,9 21,9.5 16,14 17.5,21 12,17.5 6.5,21 8,14 3,9.5 9.5,9\"/></svg>\n        Compliments For Only 129 kr\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- LISTICLE -->\n  <section class=\"ts-listicle-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ts-listicle-inner\">\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">1</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc15.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer holding bottle\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>One Spray Lasts All Day, No Re-Spraying, No Bottle In Your Bag</h3>\n          <p>If you've ever had to re-spray after lunch just to stay fresh, you know how frustrating it gets. Most scents fade within four to six hours because the perfume oil concentration simply isn't high enough to last.</p>\n          <p>TryScents <strong>21% perfume oil</strong> means one spray in the morning carries you through <strong>12 hours or more</strong>: meetings, dinners, late nights. You put it on once and then forget about it.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">2</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc13.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer review — people ask what scent you're wearing\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>People Will Stop And Ask What Scent You're Wearing</h3>\n          <p>This isn't a skin scent people have to lean in close to notice. TryScent <strong>fills the room the second you walk in</strong>. Colleagues, strangers, dates. They notice it, and they ask.</p>\n          <p>It's the difference between a scent that technically works and one that <strong>actually turns heads</strong>. You don't just wear it for yourself.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">3</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/Designerperfym.png?v=1778094986\" alt=\"Comparison with designer perfume — tested side by side\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>99% Identical To The Designer Original, Tested Side By Side</h3>\n          <p>TryScent's scents are <strong>molecularly matched</strong> against the designer originals. Not inspired by them, not similar to them. <strong>99% identical</strong>, verified through direct side-by-side comparison.</p>\n          <p>Same top notes, same dry-down, same lasting impression. The only thing missing is the logo on the box.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">4</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-17_at_10.59.01.jpg?v=1768713394\" alt=\"TryScent fragrance wardrobe — four bottles for less than a single designer purchase\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>Build A Whole Fragrance Wardrobe For A Fraction Of The Price</h3>\n          <p>A single designer bottle can cost upwards of 2,000 kr and lasts about a month with regular use. That's <strong>over 24,000 kr a year</strong> to wear a single scent.</p>\n          <p>Right now: <strong>buy three TryScent bottles and get one free</strong>. Four bottles, four different scents, for less than the price of a single designer purchase. Switch by season, mood or occasion, without feeling guilty about emptying an expensive bottle.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"ts-point\">\n        <div class=\"ts-point-img\">\n          <span class=\"ts-point-num\">5</span>\n          <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0086/7932/5753/files/ugc8.png?v=1756129303\" alt=\"TryScent customer — risk-free 60-day trial\">\n          <div class=\"ts-badge-60\">\n            <span class=\"ts-num\">60</span>\n            <span class=\"ts-lbl\">Days<br>Guarantee</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ts-point-body\">\n          <h3>60-Day Open Purchase, Nothing To Lose</h3>\n          <p>If for any reason TryScent isn't what you expected, you have <strong>60 days to return it and get every penny back</strong>. No questions asked.</p>\n          <p>With a guarantee that long there's <strong>no risk in trying</strong>. Only in waiting.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- SOCIAL PROOF -->\n  <section class=\"ts-proof\">\n    <div class=\"ts-proof-top\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Why TryScent Won't Disappoint You Like Other Dupes</h2>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"ts-proof-list\">\n        <li>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg>\n          <span><strong>Up to 21% EDP concentration:</strong> significantly richer than the 12 to 15% most designer perfumes contain.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,12 10,18 20,6\"/></svg>\n          <span><strong>EU-made, IFRA-certified:</strong> made to the same ingredient standards as luxury brands that charge 10 times more.</span>\n        </li>\n        <li>\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polyline points=\"4,1